      "grid_message_index_0based": 22,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "というよりも、王子の方が私にメロメロだからな。\n時折、甘えたように私を見る――ふっ、困った男だ。",
      "jp_sha256": "8a1eb77e801fdae815bc2a3c1f0489bd449de9fab66f02636df744c5b812633d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그보다 왕자 쪽이 내게 푹 빠졌지.\n때때로 응석부리듯 나를 바라본다―― 흐, 곤란한 남자야.",
      "message_index_0based": 22,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 64,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
